  "sourceUrl": "https://openplatform.byd.com/#/document/index?id=13",
  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>『倍轻松』智能眼罩</strong></span></h1><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1. 车机联动功能</strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">倍轻松智能眼罩通过蓝牙协议接入“智慧物联APP</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">”，用户通过车机大屏或者车内语音助手，实现对智能眼罩热敷、按摩、模式调节等功能。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/30a4d29313cb4b209bbc09a87fec3b5b.jpg?auth_key=1795677429-d0e198e228ab4acca8bcc16ee090e911-0-8a5d7425c5e7d63cfa40ac6e04b6fc6bd6308b6fd89dcb4b98234b198f3b52d5\" alt=\"画板 8.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 412.00px;height: 552.34px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-1 眼罩车机联动</span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px;\"><strong>1.1 车机大屏控制</strong></span></h3><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">模式支持“美眼”、“护眼”、“睡眠”三种模式切换;</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">振动强度支持“关闭”、“轻柔”、“适中”、“强劲”四挡调节;</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">温控支持“低档”、“高档”两档调节;</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/3d643aa6bdd541f5938f6daef9cd06c8.png?auth_key=1795677429-bba3ad510d3b4f7a816511869afebcd6-0-72be26f642cac4e78e647f78b5386ad43d1434c0c1f9ee89e896be4fc282a46b\" alt=\"首页-眼罩@2x.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 603.00px;height: 339.17px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-2 车机端智慧物联App眼罩控制界面</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.2 车机语音功能</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机智能语音实现了车机大屏控制眼罩的全部功能。方便用户解放双手，畅享按摩。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/e566ca043c5446d680d33f14c62a004d.jpg?auth_key=1795677429-2434648931db4e22b808810d46cb0bda-0-398d3499147c82b214f1e60cf0250932e984f24164e9b9f2ae1c02cd3be88a6c\" alt=\"动物世界配音.00_00_31_12.Still001.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 447.00px;height: 251.42px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/7900bc67ad3544d8991bfb7d42e0ae74.jpg?auth_key=1795677429-36123b3fcc2e4d14a4b5a280065738a5-0-bb3c4d1b8963b697a558cf2be78de18f07a07e85d0b825421ab27759cdeb726f\" alt=\"智能眼罩_场景海报01.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 450.00px;height: 660.41px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-3 车内语音控制眼罩</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.3 车机场景自动化</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">小憩场景(车机大屏及车机语音功能实现)</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">按压时长设置功能；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">按压时长显示功能；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">设备冷敷功能；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">设备冷热交替功能；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/e2e8c50a798045078fc8574ab9efffd3.png?auth_key=1795677429-c1d16a878c25483dbd143e4a7d2264a6-0-43175e13884fc7a6d14c7c7891d6f9f0229b717d217396aa0d3f604a56abd2a4\" alt=\"场景-日常通行-舒缓放松@2x.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 624.00px;height: 350.95px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-4 场景自动化</span></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2. 手机控制功能</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">眼罩离开车机的使用场景中，手机也可控制眼罩的功能。从手机端比亚迪App的\"我的-&gt;智慧物联\"，选择智能眼罩，进入眼罩的控制界面，该界面可显示并控制眼罩剩余电量、冷/热敷状态、按压剩余时间、当前模式等。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/f497aa3074c945748933314280b70d77.png?auth_key=1795677429-5b79b09362234466a1afcfe8576369e6-0-54ca0bc0ac0dd8b0509c5836f0653f131d69799a5328c439de8d53a5b2e06705\" alt=\"output (1).png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 372.00px;height: 1136.81px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-1 手机控制眼罩</span></p>"
}
